{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/packages/pulls/74","id":4951207654,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUJ8YLs8AAAABJx1u5g","html_url":"https://github.com/WuKongIM/packages/pull/74","diff_url":"https://github.com/WuKongIM/packages/pull/74.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/WuKongIM/packages/pull/74.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/packages/issues/74","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/packages/pulls/74/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/packages/pulls/74/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/packages/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/packages/issues/74/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/packages/statuses/f2c37e92b09bcd11599d31449bbca5de0ac52c25","number":74,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add stable native client acceptance and A/B drills","user":{"login":"tangtaoit","id":3895878,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4OTU4Nzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3895878?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit","html_url":"https://github.com/tangtaoit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"为 stable 候选增加精确版本、来源提交和实际安装后 CLI 验收，并从固定 fc182212 产品源码构建两代 TEST ONLY 包，验证 Ubuntu、Debian、Rocky、Alma 的下载、安装、缓存及版本切换。\n\n新增独立只读 Linux job，要求 49 个原生案例全部通过，覆盖错误签名/TLS、缺失或损坏元数据、旧目标、错来源和缺失 wkcli，并核验本次 Docker 资源零遗留。stable composite 对已验签的两个 APT 索引补齐 SHA512 不可变别名，与原 SHA256 路径同时保留；使用原 archive member 的同一有界读取，客户端保留默认哈希选择。原签名、archive、preview 行为和 34 个签名/控制/发布文件保持原字节。包含 CHANGELOG 条目。\n\n首两代 Linux CI 的 Pages 与原有完整签名仓库演练通过；新增 49 案例先被不可用的 Rocky pin 阻止，再在 Debian HTTPS EOF 处失败。固定镜像、真实 TLS 关闭通知和默认 SHA512 路径缺口已修复，原失败没有重跑或覆盖。独审进一步拦下了 by-hash 负例的预发送记录误判，修复后要求完成服务器写入及客户端对应错误，两者共同证明故障生效。49 项仍须在本次最终提交的首次 Linux CI 中实跑。\n\n验证记录：前一修复冻结的 499 项全量 Python 测试通过（Mac 1 项既有 native RPM 环境跳过），4 项合同检查通过；最终差量的聚焦回归与独审结果另附于交付证据。5 项 planner guard 测试是在实现后补充，原始日志和顺序偏差已记录，不宣称全程测试先行。\n\nstable 保持关闭。这些 TEST ONLY 验收不替代生产来源认证、对象存储/CDN 接入或正式版本公网 APT/RPM 安装验收。\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-21T12:02:22Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T12:45:36Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"3ca7c376fc9cef29f0530886c893dd82a7609bf4","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"WuKongIM:codex/stable-native-clients","ref":"codex/stable-native-clients","repo":{"id":1352603694,"node_id":"R_kgDOUJ8YLg","name":"packages","full_name":"WuKongIM/packages","owner":{"login":"WuKongIM","id":132860831,"node_id":"O_kgDOB-tLnw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132860831?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM","html_url":"https://github.com/WuKongIM","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/events{/pri